action:
Use case: stylized-concept. Asset: transparent eight-pose full-body sprite sheet for CANCEL CITY Gordon Ramen CC014. Reference image1 is authoritative identity AND rough scratched card illustration style; image2 only shows exact full-body clothes and props.
LAYOUT: exactly EIGHT whole-body intact figures arranged TWO COLUMNS by FOUR ROWS on a portrait canvas. Consistent scale, three-quarter camera facing screen-right, entire hair, boots and props fully visible in every cell. Clear transparent gutters on all four sides of every figure. Never let figures or tools touch neighbors. Do not maximize figure size at expense of gutters.
Character identity: furious middle-aged celebrity-chef parody, deeply creased sun-reddened face, broad jaw, bulging furious pale eyes, wild short spiky blond hair with dark roots. White double-breasted chef jacket, rolled sleeves, tiny food stains, black loose chef trousers and chunky black lace-up combat kitchen boots. Right hand holds short silver fork; left holds large magenta-red instant-noodle cup with abstract yellow/teal splashes and NO lettering. No chef hat or apron.
Style: extremely harsh dense black scratched etching, crosshatching, stipple, ugly expressive caricature face, cheap lurid screenprint texture, matching the CURRENT CARD. No clean anime/vector, smooth glossy illustration, cute cartoon or photo realism.
Eight frames, left-to-right each row:
1 furious chef ready, both arms lowered, cup in left and fork in right;
2 raises fork to mouth to taste one small noodle from the cup, eyes suspicious;
3 disgusted recoil from taste, face scrunched, head pulls back, still holding cup upright;
4 raises noodle cup to shoulder height with angry grimace, fork lowered;
5 winds up aggressive forward cup cast, torso twisted but whole body attached;
6 cup cast halfway forward, lunges toward screen-right with left hand gripping cup and right fork hand thrusting forward;
7 maximum forward cast followthrough, front knee bent, shouting face, NO noodles flying;
8 incredulous followthrough, cup draws back near chest, fork hand still extended, mouth agape in furious disbelief.
Only intact character and held utensils/cup. The cup remains in his hand every frame. Tiny noodles inside cup permitted, NO long noodle whip, detached food, projectile, steam, smoke, splatter particles, aura, ground, shadow, scene, text, captions, labels, border or watermark. Genuinely transparent outside every figure.

ending:
Use case: stylized-concept. Asset: second transparent eight-frame full-body sprite sheet for Gordon Ramen CC014, continuing EXACT appearance from supplied action sheet. Official card image1 is authority for harsh ugly etched style; action sheet image2 is authority for clothes, cup, fork and body construction.
Exactly EIGHT whole-body figures on a PORTRAIT canvas, TWO COLUMNS by FOUR ROWS. Each figure's full blond hair, boots, hands and held objects fully visible within a generous separate cell. Wide transparent gutters between every silhouette, no cut-off boot or adjacent touching.
Character: same furious middle-aged male celebrity-chef parody with short wild spiky blond hair/dark roots, sunburnt deeply creased face, bulging pale eyes and broad jaw. Food-stained white double-breasted chef jacket with rolled sleeves, black loose trousers, black chunky lace-up boots. Large bright magenta-red instant-noodle cup with abstract yellow/teal splashes and NO text; short silver fork. Keep colors and face identical across all frames. No hat or apron.
Pose order left-to-right every row:
1 folded arms, cup pinned in crook of left elbow and fork in right hand, chin high with disdain;
2 stern inspection, extends cup slightly, suspicious narrowed eyes peers down into cup;
3 delivers furious verdict, mouth shouts wide, right fork hand chops air while left grips cup;
4 points fork tip at ONE short noodle still attached inside cup, eyes furious;
5 pushes the cup away from himself toward screen-right with left hand, nose wrinkled in disgust;
6 fed-up, shoulders sag and face incredulous, cup held down and fork loose;
7 deadpan disgusted stare, eyebrows low, cup close to chest and fork points down;
8 final dinner declined pose, turns his chest slightly away, closes eyes and raises right palm dismissively while fork rests against palm and cup stays secure in left hand.
Dense harsh black scratched etching, crosshatched linework and stipple, lurid cheap-print card texture, ugly expressive anatomy and wrinkles. NOT polished anime, clean vector, generic cartoon, photorealistic or smooth digital paint. One intact body per pose, hands and boots connected, no detached pieces. No flying noodles, noodle whip, long noodle strand, steam, smoke, projectile, aura, food debris, scenery, floor, ground shadow, text, labels, border or watermark. True transparent outside figures.
